  "ja534:57.4": "imāyo dasadhā disā. ",
  "ja534:58.1": "oggayha te pokkharaṇiṃ ",
  "ja534:58.2": "vippasannodakaṃ suciṃ ",
  "ja534:58.3": "pahūtaṃ khādanaṃ tattha ",
